	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["5EDC9934E7D346D8"]
			description: [
				"&2The Overworld&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/overworld_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The &2Overworld&r serves as the starting point for your progression in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. It provides essential materials, early-game resources, and the environments needed to establish your initial infrastructure. From basic tool creation to your first attempts at automation, this dimension supports every foundational step of your journey."
				""
				"Explore forests, plains, and expansive cave networks as you gather resources, construct your first shelter, and prepare the systems that will carry you into more advanced content."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lFrom Survival to Mastery&r"
				"Progression in the Overworld involves more than resource collection. Managing hunger, preparing reliable food sources, maintaining safety during exploration, and experimenting with early automation all contribute to your long-term success."
				""
				"Establish farms, reinforce your base, and begin integrating Create components as you transition from basic survival toward structured engineering."
				""
				"Each improvement you make strengthens your ability to tackle future challenges."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lThe Journey Begins Here&r"
				"Your efforts in the Overworld form the groundwork for the dimensions and technologies that follow. The systems you build and the experience you gain here directly support your progression into the Nether, the End, and beyond."
				""
				"Master this environment, refine your early infrastructure, and prepare for the increasingly complex objectives ahead."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "minecraft:grass_block"
			id: "5DA842A1588FB8BE"
			rewards: [{
				id: "579D97F778BAF7DC"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 3.0d
			subtitle: "Begin your journey in the Overworld and establish the foundation for all progression. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				id: "761B1BC0C077AD23"
				item: {
					Count: 1
