					tag: {
						value: "minecraft:logs"
					}
				}
				title: "Any #minecraft:logs"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&6Roots of Adventure&r"
			x: -12.5d
			y: -6.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&cThe Nether&r introduces one of the most challenging progression environments in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. Its terrain, hostile mobs, and unique resource pools require careful preparation and strategic planning."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/nether_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Accessed through &cNether Remastered&r, this dimension features dangerous landscapes shaped by lava flows, hostile mobs such as ghasts and blazes, and structures including fortresses and bastions. These locations contain essential materials and progression items needed for mid-game crafting, brewing, and advanced systems."
				""
				"Your goal extends beyond basic survival. Effective exploration, resource collection, and combat readiness are key to advancing through the challenges found here."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Equip yourself properly, maintain awareness of your surroundings, and approach each structure with caution. The Nether plays a pivotal role in your progression—master its hazards to unlock the resources and pathways required for future advancement."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "minecraft:netherrack"
			id: "3F3994EDD215FC99"
			rewards: [{
				id: "7449C4C2ED39AD05"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 3.0d
			subtitle: "Enter the Nether and begin your progression through its hazards and resources. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				dimension: "minecraft:the_nether"
				icon: "minecraft:netherrack"
				id: "21AF3C45D5058473"
				type: "dimension"
			}]
			title: "&6Into the Inferno&r"
			x: 9.5d
			y: -6.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&8The Deep Dark&r is a specialized late-game biome defined by low visibility, restricted movement, and sound-triggered hazards. Exploration here requires caution, preparation, and an understanding of how the sculk ecosystem responds to player activity."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ancient_city_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Located within the lowest caverns of the world, &8Ancient Cities&r serve as the primary structures in this biome. These ruins contain valuable loot, unique materials, and the key components required to advance toward the next dimension. However, they are also patrolled by the &cWarden&r—a powerful entity designed to punish noise and detect vibration rather than sight."
				""
				"To operate effectively in the Deep Dark, minimize sound, avoid triggering sculk sensors, and navigate deliberately through each section of the city."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Defeating the Warden grants access to the &eHeart of the Warden&r, a critical item used to activate the portal leading to the &5Otherside&r. This marks an important progression milestone and opens a path to a dimension featuring new biomes, resources, and late-game challenges."
				""
				"Entering the Otherside is not simply another step—it is a transition into content designed to test advanced combat, navigation, and resource management skills."
				""
				"Prepare carefully, assess each encounter, and advance only when ready."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "minecraft:sculk_sensor"
			id: "638EF7DB16108237"
			rewards: [{
				id: "1676A81A243A25F8"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 250
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 3.0d
			subtitle: "Descend into the Deep Dark, confront the Warden, and unlock access to the Otherside. Click for more info!"
			tasks: [{
				biome: "minecraft:deep_dark"
				icon: "minecraft:sculk_shrieker"
				id: "15BC7C1F753B1EBB"
				type: "biome"
			}]
			title: "&6Beneath Silence&r"
			x: -13.5d
			y: 9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0135EFA96E7A28A2"]
			description: [
				"The &5End&r represents the beginning of late-game progression within &6Create - Forge Frontier&r. This dimension consists of fractured islands suspended over the void, requiring careful navigation and reliable mobility tools to explore safely."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/end_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Your initial objective is the confrontation with the &cEnder Dragon&r. Defeating it provides access to outer islands, specialized structures, and the unique materials found only within this realm. These include &3Radiantite&r, &7Void Shale&r, and &fPalerock&r—resources that support advanced crafting, equipment upgrades, and several endgame systems."
				""
				"The End features a variety of environmental hazards and hostile entities. &dShulkers&r introduce levitation mechanics that require spatial awareness, while &8Endermen&r react to player interaction and environmental stimuli. Preparation, proper gear, and controlled movement are essential for safe exploration."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Progress in the End unlocks late-game opportunities, new technologies, and pathways toward interdimensional expansion. The materials and knowledge gained here form the foundation of higher-tier engineering and long-term progression goals."
				""
				"Your advancement through this dimension marks the transition into endgame content and the next phase of your journey."
			]
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			id: "7964AB0D39902EFA"
			rewards: [{
				id: "681278DA6D713D88"
