		{
			dependencies: ["5DA842A1588FB8BE"]
			description: [
				"Floating high above the Overworld's oceans is &bAcropolis&r, a city in the sky filled to the brim with Mythological Creatures. "
				""
				"Atop the vast seastone structure is Scylla - The Ancient Storm Empress, who stands in the way of you and The End. "
				""
				"Will you brave the heights of &bAcropolis&r and defeat Scylla, or fall back to the surface in defeat?"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/acropolis.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As you ascend higher and higher into the upper reaches of &bAcropolis&r, you will find that much of the loot is guarded by a terrible foe: The &dHippocamptus&r!"
				""
				"As you loot the structure, slay 5 of these creatures and keep moving upwards!"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"As you make your way through &bAcropolis&r, you will encounter the hulking Clawdian, a massive crab with an equally massive hammer that wants to smash you into pieces. "
				""
				"Watch out for his charge attack - use the speed potion to avoid it. Defeat the &cClawdian&r, and keep moving upwards!"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/clawdian.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"At the pinnacle of the &bAcropolis&r lies a dormant anchor, shrouded in silence. Gather your strength and steel your resolve, for only the prepared may endure what follows."
				""
				"When you are ready, right click the anchor. At your touch, &3Scylla&r will tear through the skies like a bolt of thunder, descending to challenge you in furious combat."
				""
				"Only by defeating &3Scylla&r can you claim her essence. Once she is slain, you must seize the Essence of Storm, a fragment of her boundless power. With this, the path opens to forge the Aetheric Eye, bringing you one step closer to The End."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/scylla_1.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"Learn more on the next page."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Watch out for her many attacks. If she hits you with a wave attack and applies the \"Wetness\" debuff, you become way more susceptible to her lightning attacks. You can block this attack with a shield or by using blocks. "
				""
				"Good luck. You're gonna need it."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/scylla_2.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
			]
