		{
			dependencies: ["5DA842A1588FB8BE"]
			description: [
				"In &cNether Remastered&r, access to the Nether is no longer achieved through a standard obsidian portal. Instead, entry is tied to a progression system inspired by the structure-based design of End Remastered. This approach transforms the Nether from an early-game shortcut into a meaningful mid-game milestone."
				""
				"To activate the portal, you must explore the Overworld, locate designated structures, and obtain the components required to craft the &6Seal of the Underworld&r. Consuming this seal unlocks the gateway and grants controlled entry into the dimension."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Once inside, the Nether has been significantly expanded through multiple mods, offering new biomes, updated terrain, and enhanced structure variety. These additions introduce fresh opportunities for resource gathering, brewing materials, and mid-game technological progression."
				""
				"The dimension now features unique mechanics, environmentally driven challenges, and a broader selection of enemies and loot. Successful navigation requires preparation, defensive planning, and the ability to adapt to rapidly changing terrain."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The reworked Nether serves as a progression test rather than a simple travel point. Completing its objectives and securing its resources provides the foundation for crafting systems, engineering paths, and future dimensional advancement."
				""
				"{image:nether_remastered:textures/nether_remastered.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
			]
			icon: "nether_remastered:seal_of_the_underworld_item"
